1144 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Work Experience\nFull\055Stack AI Engineer\054 MeshEver \174 Chattogram \174 Jan 2026 \205 Present\nBuilding Zasmate\054 a multi\055tenant AI SaaS that answers customers for businesses across 7 channels \050WhatsApp\054 Messenger\054 Instagram\054 web chat\054 email\054 Telegram\054 SMS\051 in Bangla\054 Banglish and English\056\nEnforced tenant isolation with PostgreSQL RLS\072 tenant\055scoped transactions under a restricted role\054 and a startup check that fails if the connection can bypass RLS\056\nBuilt the RAG agent \050pgvector plus keyword search\051 over each vendor\047s catalogue\056 It hands off to a person when confidence is low and holds replies for approval when retrieval fails\056 Integrated Meta\047s Graph API webhooks for messages and comment replies\056\n\nFull\055Stack Developer\054 3Zero Digital \174 Chattogram \174 Jan 2025 \205 Dec 2025\nRaised backend throughput 45\045 and cut latency 50\045 with a worker\055pool architecture and batched writes\056 Deployed agentic RAG on MCP servers that cut support tickets \17625\045\056\n\nFreelance Full\055Stack Engineer \174 Remote \174 Mar 2023 \205 Dec 2024\072\nFull Stack Projects\054 Secure backends\054 real\055time APIs and performance tuning for client systems\056)
     /K [ 12 ]
     /P 1145 0 R
